{
  "_readme": [
    "Every source here is free and needs no API key. GitHub sources work",
    "unauthenticated at 60 requests/hour; set GITHUB_TOKEN for 5000.",
    "",
    "tier: 'primary'   = the project's own announcement. Safe to cite as fact.",
    "      'reputable' = established publication. Cite, but prefer the primary link.",
    "      'community' = discovery signal only. Never cited as a factual source.",
    "",
    "weight: 0.5-1.5. How well this outlet matches YOUR subjects. Multiplies relevance.",
    "reach:  1-5.     How large this outlet's developer audience is. Feeds the",
    "                 audience-interest score. A niche newsletter can be highly",
    "                 relevant to you (high weight) and still small (low reach).",
    "",
    "Every URL below was probed with `npm run sources -- --check` and returned",
    "usable items. Feeds still rot: re-run that command when something looks",
    "quiet, and disable whatever fails."
  ],
